THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
----------------------

The device tree source and the OpenWrt build integration are derived from OpenWrt
(GPL-2.0).

Released binary images embed the vendor's ath10k board files (per-model radio
calibration data extracted from the stock firmware), because the radios do not
function without them. Those files are not the work of the author, are not
covered by this licence, and no licence to them is granted here. They are
included on the same basis as OpenWrt's own ipq-wifi packages. Build from source
with board files extracted from your own device if you prefer not to rely on that.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, authorised by, or supported by Motorola, Minim,
Qualcomm, or the OpenWrt project. All trademarks are the property of their
respective owners and are used solely to describe hardware compatibility.
